# Large received assets — deliberately not tracked.
#
# These are read-only inputs to the documentation effort, not work product.
# They total ~2.7 GB, never change, and would bloat the repository (git would
# hold a second compressed copy of every binary). Remove a line below and run
# `git add` if you decide you want one of them versioned; consider Git LFS for
# the flash images and photographs.

# HiSilicon vendor SDK (2.5 GB)
Hi3531_V100R001C01SPC0D1/

# Flash and filesystem images (187 MB) — verified backups, hashed in their own
# MANIFEST.md, with a second copy on the Raspberry Pi
backups/

# Export of the DVR's filesystem (49 MB)
rootfs/

# PCB photographs (36 MB)
pcb/

# Reference datasheets retained locally
datasheets/

# macOS cruft
.DS_Store
._*

# vendor docs
*.pdf
